WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.830
VADIM SOLOVEY: The
company called TabTale.

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:07.360
They do games for kids
for mobile devices

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.640
like iOS or Android.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.350
They want to release a
new game every two weeks.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.260
So if you look
from the technology

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:16.900
part of that equation,
this is something really,

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:17.910
really challenging.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.420
With Google Cloud Platform
and Google App Engine

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.220
specifically, it actually
means that they can deploy

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:24.700
new versions of the back end.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.550
They can support more games.

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:29.580
And that's wouldn't be
possible without something

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:30.630
like Google App Engine.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.300
We have that unique
methodology of-- we

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.730
call that "transformation
in 21 days."

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:38.470
And actually that means
that we take the customer

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:42.110
from where they are and move
them to Google Cloud Platform

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:45.730
and providing them with some
real results in just three

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:47.280
weeks.

